          "body": "\\[\ns=4t^2+\\frac{125}{t}\n\\]"
        },
        {
          "title": "Differentiate to find velocity",
          "body": "Differentiate to find velocity:\n\n\\[\nv=\\frac{ds}{dt}=8t-\\frac{125}{t^2}\n\\]"
