        {
          "title": "Volume of the hemisphere",
          "body": "Volume of the hemisphere:\n\n\\[\n\\frac23\\pi r^3=\\frac23\\pi(20)^3=\\frac{16000}{3}\\pi\n\\]"
        },
        {
          "title": "Total volume",
          "body": "Total volume:\n\n\\[\n2800\\pi+\\frac{16000}{3}\\pi\n=\\frac{24400}{3}\\pi\n\\]"
        },
        {
          "title": "Calculate area",
          "body": "Since the volume is \\(k\\pi\\),\n\n\\[\nk=\\frac{24400}{3}\n\\]"
