          "title": "Solve simultaneous equations",
          "body": "If \\(y=-5\\),\n\n\\[\nx=2(-5)+3=-7\n\\]"
        }
      ],
      "finalAnswer": "\\(\\left(\\frac73,-\\frac13\\right)\\) and \\((-7,-5)\\)."
    },
